                                                "sense_id": "62c04f0a-b4aa-30f7-82f6-99995fd2ec0d",
                                                "text": "This is the 6 ft. 4-6-0 engine No. 8301, Springbok, the second design produced by Mr. Edward Thompson since his accession to office as Chief Mechanical Engineer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28b3c6fa-5028-4b0d-a7ad-e013ec34dfc7",
                                                "sense_id": "62c04f0a-b4aa-30f7-82f6-99995fd2ec0d",
                                                "text": "Charles will be formally proclaimed King at a historic Accession Council in an ancient ceremony at St James’s Palace on Saturday, it has been announced."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d19de3db-bcee-38f5-9137-9c248f019acf",
